              "827": "economic support"
            },
            "note": {
              "819": [
                "Refers to the proportion of children whose family has at least one of the types of social assistance, or the proportion of the familys income these types of social assistance represent."
              ],
              "823": [
                "Maintenance support includes both maintenance support (administered by the Swedish Social Insurance Agency) and maintenance allowance (which is handled directly by the parents). Information on maintenance allowance is not available in administrative registers, and therefore based on a model. For statistics that refer to the year 2021, this model has been updated, which means that the proportion of children with maintenance allowance will be lower, while the share of disposable income for those with maintenance allowance will be higher."
              ]
